    "title": "Aggressive shark spotted at Makua Beach - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jeremiah Estrada ,\n1 hours ago WAIANAE, Hawaii (Island News) -- Lifeguards have posted warning signs after an aggressive shark were seen in the waters of Makua Beach on Wednesday. The shark sighting was confirmed by Honolulu Ocean Safety prompting an alert just after 5 p.m. An eight-foot long shark was spotted 300 feet from the shore at the beach. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
